{"about_the_game":"You will play as a protagonist at life's turning point. <br>Battle after battle, you'll uncover the true path of this world.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926770/extras/ec2678358c720816ff9ce3bcd59ee53d.webp?t=1761204372\" width=600 height=60 /></span><br><br><br><br>Combat unfolds in a semi-automated manner.<br>The skill cards you played during the combat will define pivotal moments.\u200b<br>Find your rhythm, manage your resources wisely, and emerge victorious from the swirling chaos of each encounter.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926770/extras/730054d4019fa5ef80beed7693b114cf.avif?t=1761204372\" width=600 height=240 /></span><br><br><br><br>Following every battle and event, you have the chance to gain new companions.<br>Each of them comes with distinct cards and abilities, creating intriguing synergies with one another.<br>Adapt your lineup to the situation and forge your ideal team.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926770/extras/b157e767161de4b62316188bcbb047dd.avif?t=1761204372\" width=600 height=240 /></span><br><br><br><br>Each and every character features their own card deck and progression system.<br>As you advance through the game,<br>they'll gradually unlock their latent potential, which will have you regularly reconsidering and adjusting their tactical roles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926770/extras/2376b9e39ee870589ceb0d3a7418a61b.avif?t=1761204372\" width=600 height=240 /></span><br><br><br><br>Between fights, the tapestry of the story will slowly reveal itself.<br>Main and side stories are interwoven, shedding light on the destinies of both the characters and the world.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926770/extras/4f20b643463286deb7d5c8dfba2775ce.avif?t=1761204372\" width=600 height=240 /></span><br><br><br><br>Perhaps nothing can be changed in the very end.<br>Yet, someone is always on the road.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926770/extras/18e0224489aec75eb8733f6f65c8d21f.avif?t=1761204372\" width=600 height=240 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3926770?t=1761204372","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3926770?t=1761204372","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926770/211d3cded17a391e38c3fdf0c74cd6e9ab2272f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761204372","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926770/211d3cded17a391e38c3fdf0c74cd6e9ab2272f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761204372","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"You will play as a protagonist at life's turning point. <br>Battle after battle, you'll uncover the true path of this world.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926770/extras/ec2678358c720816ff9ce3bcd59ee53d.webp?t=1761204372\" width=600 height=60 /></span><br><br><br><br>Combat unfolds in a semi-automated manner.